<title>HONG KONG: Shanghai Growth 1996 net down 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Growth 1996 net down 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   6.9	 vs 19.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
